 "note": "Identified from the printed title 'THOMAS C. PASSIOS ELEMENTARY SCHOOL FACULTY/STAFF' (line 1) and principal Christine Bonci. Two columns placed by Textract x-position: left = label + name (OFFICE) or homeroom code + name (GRADE n); right = a label column (~0.50) and a name column (~0.64-0.70). role_raw is the label printed on the person's own line; grade_or_dept is the nearest heading or label above them in their own column (so unlabelled names under 'Learning Center Tutor' or 'Achieve Assistant' carry that label as printed above them -- a reading of layout, not a stated title). Lines 11, 15 and 30 carry a heading in one column and a person in the other and are entry lines; line 20 (GRADE 4) is a heading alone. Line 12 prints 'Technology Dana Belair' in the name column; Technology recorded as his role. Custodian and Cafeteria labels (lines 39, 41) sit below SPECIAL SERVICES but are recorded with no section, as they are not special services. Line 45 is the page number."
